# (the voices batch, item 2) Pluck, a plucked string, on both sequences' ALGORITHM: the Sequence's sixth voice (after
# Glass: five turns on from 2600; the FM voices after it since item 5, so one turn back now
# lands on the last of them), Sequence 2's seventh (after Sub, which keeps its place); said, kept in the project,
# its page shown with it, heard (its strings struck as Timewind plays), and kept over a restart
wait 300
listen
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
turn ALGO 5
wait 300
said VOICE Pluck
expect par33 5
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 9
said Seq sound page, voice Pluck: Cutoff 45, Decay 35, Reverb 50, Echo 50
shot seqpluck.png
turn ALGO -5
wait 300
said VOICE 2600
expect par33 0
turn ALGO 5
wait 300
said VOICE Pluck
expect par33 5
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 4
spin ALGO 5
wait 300
said VOICE Pluck
expect par35 6
spin ALGO -1
wait 300
said VOICE Sub
expect par35 5
spin ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Pluck
expect par35 6
spin ALGO -6
wait 300
said VOICE 2600
expect par35 0
spin ALGO 6
wait 300
expect par35 6
wait 8000
expect ksstruck >0
# kept: stopped, it saves itself; the same after a restart (the save's format as it was: 8; Pluck appended, nothing
# moved)
tap PLAY
wait 6000
expect dirty 0
expect store_writes >0
reboot
wait 500
expect format 9
expect par33 5
expect par35 6
